[{"id":"python-object-float","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","float","Decimal","数值"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(三)对象、变量与运算.md","articleTitle":"Python(三)对象、变量与运算","articlePath":"posts/76bec403/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(三)对象、变量与运算.md","articleTitle":"Python(三)对象、变量与运算","articlePath":"posts/76bec403/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么 \u003ccode>0.1 + 0.2 == 0.3\u003c/code> 通常为假？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>这三个十进制小数多数不能被二进制浮点精确表示，运算结果是相近值而不是精确值。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>近似值比较使用 \u003ccode>math.isclose()\u003c/code> 和领域容差；需要十进制精确规则时，从字符串构造 \u003ccode>Decimal\u003c/code>。不要依赖显示时的四舍五入来判断数值是否相等。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]